- Any 1099‑NEC / 1099‑MISC from consulting clients
- Records/receipts for the $950 business expenses (if business)
- Rent statements, utility bills, renter’s insurance—evidence to allocate home office share if using regular method
- 1098‑E for student loan interest paid in 2024 (from MOHELA)
- Receipts or acknowledgement for the $1,400 donation to Northwest Harvest
- Records of any state tax paid, mortgage interest, property taxes, etc.

Estimate example (rough, using assumptions you gave)
