Documentation to keep
- Receipts for charitable contributions (you said you have a receipt for Northwest Harvest).
- MOHELA statement showing interest paid in the year.
- Records of rent, utilities, and any bills that support the home‑office allocation.
- Records for the $950 in expenses (if they are business expenses).
- 1099s and W‑2.

Quick numerical example (to illustrate)
