Important legal note: I’m not a CPA or tax attorney. This is general guidance. For final filing or complicated items, please confirm with a tax professional.

1) Quick summary of your situation (from what you gave)
- Filing status: Married filing jointly (federal), living in Phoenix, AZ.
- Income:
  - W-2 from Riverside Hospital: $79,400
  - Consulting: $12,500 (you said “6 clients” — need to know if this was self‑employment / 1099 work)
  - Interest: $920 (Goldman Sachs Marcus) + $480 (TD Ameritrade) = $1,400 interest
- Deductions/expenses you listed:
