2. Is the $950 of unreimbursed expenses related to your consulting business (list types of expenses and amounts)?
3. Any other deductible expenses (state income taxes paid, property tax, mortgage interest, large medical expenses, major charity gifts beyond $1,400)?
4. Do you have 1099s for your consulting work (or was it all paid without 1099s)?

