- Qualified Business Income (QBI) deduction (Sec. 199A): you may be eligible for up to 20% of qualified business income from the consulting (subject to limits based on taxable income and type of services). With your income shown, you may be under phase-in thresholds — it may provide an additional deduction; your tax preparer or software will compute this.

