1) Income to report
- W‑2 (Riverside Hospital): $79,400
- Self‑employment (consulting): $12,500 — report on Schedule C
- Interest: $920 (Goldman Sachs Marcus) + $480 (TD Ameritrade) = $1,400 — report on Form 1040 (Schedule B only required if combined interest/dividends exceed $1,500)

Total gross income ≈ $93,300

