Arizona (state) filing
- Arizona resident return (Form 140 for residents). AZ starts from federal AGI with state modifications; whether you itemize on AZ can differ but typically you’d take AZ standard deduction if you take federal standard deduction. Check AZ instructions for student loan interest treatment; usually it follows federal but verify for 2024.

Records to keep / documentation
