- With a positive net Schedule C profit, you may qualify for a QBI (Section 199A) deduction of up to 20% of qualified business income. With the small net profit estimated above (~$6.4k), a rough QBI deduction estimate is ~20% × $6,438 ≈ $1,288. The QBI calculation has limitations and can be complex; you may be eligible for the simplified Form 8995 QBI deduction.

