8) Estimated taxes / withholding
- Because of SE tax and additional income, you may owe tax beyond your W‑2 withholding. If so, either: (a) pay estimated quarterly taxes via Form 1040‑ES for 2024/2025, or (b) increase withholding on the W‑2 spouse to cover the shortfall. This avoids penalties.

