- 1099‑NEC / records of the $12,500 consulting income (bank deposits, invoices)  
- 1099‑INTs for the $920 and $480 interest income  
- MOHELA statement or 1098‑E showing student loan interest paid  
- Receipts for the $1,400 charitable donation  
- Receipts / records for the $950 unreimbursed expenses and clarification whether they’re business related  
- Records supporting exclusive use and square footage of office, monthly rent and utilities, renter’s insurance, etc.

