- Unreimbursed employee business expenses (for W‑2 employees) — these are not deductible through 2025 unless you are a qualified performing artist, certain government employees, etc. If the $950 is for your self‑employment business (i.e., ordinary business expenses), then you can deduct it on Schedule C. Please confirm which it is.
