4. Did you receive any 1099‑NEC/1099‑MISC for the consulting income? (Doesn’t change the taxability, but helpful to know for documentation.)

Rough numeric comparison (to show impact of home‑office methods)
Total income before expenses = W‑2 + consulting + interest = 79,400 + 12,500 + 1,400 = 93,300.

Home office percentage = 140 / 690 ≈ 20.29%.

