- Form 1098‑E — student loan interest statement from MOHELA (if you paid interest in the filing year)
- Arizona state return (Arizona Form 140 or current AZ forms) — state rules differ; check AZ instructions for student loan interest/state adjustments

Other practical items and recordkeeping
- Keep receipts and documentation for the home office (square footage, lease, rent checks), utilities, internet portion, renter’s insurance, and the $950 business expenses.
- Keep your charitable contribution receipt(s).
